### GET museum hours
GET https://{{host}}/museum-hours
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### GET museum hours for a date range, paginated
GET https://{{host}}/museum-hours?startDate=2023-09-11&endDate=2023-09-15&page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### POST create a special event (saves eventId for the requests below)
POST https://{{host}}/special-events
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Longhorn PHP",
  "location": "Austin TX",
  "eventDescription": "A 2-day conference to help PHP developers level up their craft and connect with the larger PHP community.",
  "dates": [
    "2026-10-15",
    "2026-10-16"
  ],
  "price": 350
}

> {% client.global.set("eventId", response.body.eventId); %}

### GET list special events
GET https://{{host}}/special-events?startDate=2023-01-01&endDate=2027-12-31&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### GET a special event
GET https://{{host}}/special-events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### PATCH update a special event
PATCH https://{{host}}/special-events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "location": "Holiday Inn Austin Midtown, Austin TX",
  "price": 300
}

### POST buy a general entry ticket (saves ticketId for the QR request)
POST https://{{host}}/tickets
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketType": "general",
  "ticketDate": "2026-10-15",
  "email": "todd@example.com"
}

> {% client.global.set("ticketId", response.body.ticketId); %}

### POST buy a special event ticket
POST https://{{host}}/tickets
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ticketType": "event",
  "eventId": "{{eventId}}",
  "ticketDate": "2026-10-15",
  "email": "alena@example.com"
}

### GET ticket QR code (PNG)
GET https://{{host}}/tickets/{{ticketId}}/qr
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
Accept: image/png

### DELETE a special event
DELETE https://{{host}}/special-events/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}

### GET a special event that does not exist (404 problem+json)
GET https://{{host}}/special-events/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Basic {{username}} {{password}}
